{title: Shey Ki Jane}
{artist: Raz Dee}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F] Shey ki jane [C] ajo tui,        Kotha [Am] bolish [G] amar sathe mone mone
[F] Protidin [C] berogin,        She ki [Am] tor kotha bhabe [G] amar moton kore
[F] Tor chithi ki she [C] pore,        Ek [Am] mone majhrate [G] ektu mutchki heshe
[F] Tar kache chole [C] jawa she toh jawa noy,        [A] Dekha hobe [G] smritir gobhire
[F] She ki jane [C] obhimane toke hashate,        [Am] She ki pare buke [G] dhore toke bholate
[F] Tor priyo gaan [C] ke geye shonabe,        [Am] Bol amar theke [G] ke toke bhalo jane
[F] Ishara te khuje [C] berai toke shopone,        [Am] Tor naam deke [G] heshe feli anmone
[F] Ke niye jabe [C] toke rupkothar deshe,        [Am] Bol amar theke [G] ke toke bhalo jane
[F] Koto din hoye [C] geche,        [Am] Dekhini toke toke [G] mon dake
[F] Ghum [C] theke uthe,        [Am] Prothomei toke [G] dekhe se protidin
[F] Tar kole matha [C] rekhe kome jay ki,        [Am] tor.. [G] betha, o bol na
[F] Tobe ay fire [C] ghore eksathe boshe,        [Am] Shunbo tor [G] moner kotha
[F] She ki jane [C] obhimane toke hashate,        [Am] She ki pare buke [G] dhore toke bholate
[F] Tor priyo gaan [C] ke geye shonabe,        [Am] Bol amar theke [G] ke toke bhalo jane
[F] Ishara te khuje [C] berai toke shopone,        [Am] Tor naam deke [G] heshe feli anmone
[F] Ke niye jabe [C] toke rupkothar deshe,        [Am] Bol amar theke [G] ke toke bhalo jane
[F] Jodi mone [C] pore,        [Am] Jigesh [G] korish achi [F] kemon... [C]
Bolbo [Am] khub bhalo,        [G] Karon mitthe tai [F] aaj [C] boro priyo.. [Am]
[G] Jhoro megher akash,        [F] aaj r [C] chai na amar.. [Am]
